 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Galois covers",
 "statement": "Let $Y$ be connected with geometric point $\\bar y$. A finite etale\n$P\\to Y$, i.e. an object of $\\mathrm{F\\acute Et}(Y)$ as in\n[def-galois-categories], is a *Galois cover* if $P$ is\nconnected over $Y$ and $\\operatorname{Aut}_Y(P)$ acts simply\ntransitively on $P_{\\bar y}$.",
